---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of service — PrintHub">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: 1 January 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-6 max-w-none text-slate-700">
      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">1. Scope</h2>
      <p>These terms govern all orders placed with Demo Print GmbH (Berlin, Germany) via this storefront. Conflicting terms of the buyer apply only with our written consent.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">2. Contract formation</h2>
      <p>By submitting an order you make a binding offer. The contract is concluded when we send the order confirmation by email. For B2C orders we will provide statutory withdrawal information separately.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">3. Right of withdrawal</h2>
      <p>
        Most printed products are <strong>made to your specifications</strong> and therefore exempt from the
        14-day right of withdrawal under § 312g(2)(1) BGB. Stock items and accessories remain subject to
        the standard right of withdrawal.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">4. Prices and VAT</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
        <li>All prices are in EUR.</li>
        <li>Net prices are shown by default; VAT at the rate applicable to your delivery address is added at checkout.</li>
        <li>For B2B customers with a valid EU VAT ID outside Germany, the reverse-charge mechanism applies (0% VAT, customer accounts).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">5. Production and delivery</h2>
      <p>Standard production time is 24 hours after artwork approval. Delivery within Germany takes 1–3 business days, EU-wide 2–5 business days.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">6. Quality guarantee</h2>
      <p>If a printed item materially deviates from your approved artwork, we will reprint it free of charge. Minor colour variations within ISO 12647-2 tolerances are not considered defects.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">7. Liability and IP</h2>
      <p>By uploading artwork, you confirm you hold all rights necessary to reproduce it. We exclude liability for content provided by you. For our own services, liability is limited to gross negligence and intent except for personal-injury cases.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">8. Governing law</h2>
      <p>German law applies, place of jurisdiction is Berlin, subject to mandatory consumer-protection rules of the buyer's habitual residence.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
